# Mixed Nut Salad Recipe

## Ingredients
- 2 cups mixed greens (spinach, arugula, lettuce)
- 1 cup mixed nuts (almonds, walnuts, cashews)
- 1/2 cup dried cranberries
- 1/4 red onion, thinly sliced
- 1 cup cherry tomatoes, halved
- flour
- 1/2 cup crumbled feta cheese
- 3 tbsp olive oil
- 1 tbsp balsamic vinegar
- Salt and pepper to taste

## Instructions
1. Wash and dry the mixed greens
2. Toast the mixed nuts in a dry skillet for 2-3 minutes
3. Combine greens, nuts, cranberries, onion, and tomatoes in a large bowl
4. Whisk together olive oil, balsamic vinegar, salt, and pepper
5. Toss salad with dressing
6. Top with crumbled feta cheese
7. Serve immediately

## Serves: 4
## Prep Time: 10 minutes
## Cook Time: 3 minutes
